{"id":"n35777-1-10","stage":4,"title":"구절 · 句子","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n35777-1-10-1","ko":"고향의 어머니께서 편지를 보내셨어.","zh":"我家乡的妈妈寄来了信哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고향의","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어머니께서","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편지를","meaning":"信，书信，信件","explanation":"편지：信，书信，信件；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"편지","audio":"/audio/53bf9898bc47c0e12c02.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24147","senseId":"1","lemma":"편지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보내셨어.","meaning":"派去，送去，派遣，指派","explanation":"보내다：派去，送去，派遣，指派；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"2","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"53bf9898bc47c0e1","term":"편지","zh":"信，书信，信件","audio":"/audio/53bf9898bc47c0e12c02.mp3","entryId":"24147","definition":"把要说的话写下来寄给对方的文字内容。","pronunciation":["편ː지"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"派去，送去，派遣，指派","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"因某个任务或目的而让人去某处。","pronunciation":["보내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fdea0e13c7ce7c3380b4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n35777-1-10-2","ko":"와! 구절마다 어머니의 사랑이 배어 있는 것 같아.","zh":"哇！感觉每一句都饱含着妈妈的爱呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와!","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구절마다","meaning":"句子，段落","explanation":"구절：句子，段落；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"구절","audio":"/audio/e2d1454cce0e05d827bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35777","senseId":"1","lemma":"구절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어머니의","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사랑이","meaning":"疼爱，关爱","explanation":"사랑：疼爱，关爱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사랑","audio":"/audio/ff2763f11c21f16783f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66649","senseId":"2","lemma":"사랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배어","meaning":"渗透，蕴含，具有","explanation":"배다：渗透，蕴含，具有；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"배다","audio":"/audio/fe8bb9bce639b1ec904b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15904","senseId":"3","lemma":"배다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"e2d1454cce0e05d8","term":"구절","zh":"句子，段落","audio":"/audio/e2d1454cce0e05d827bb.mp3","entryId":"35777","definition":"一段话或文章。","pronunciation":["구절"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"ff2763f11c21f167","term":"사랑","zh":"疼爱，关爱","audio":"/audio/ff2763f11c21f16783f8.mp3","entryId":"66649","definition":"爱护珍惜并真诚相待的心。","pronunciation":["사랑"]},{"id":"fe8bb9bce639b1ec","term":"배다","zh":"渗透，蕴含，具有","audio":"/audio/fe8bb9bce639b1ec904b.mp3","entryId":"15904","definition":"某种感觉或想法等被深深地感受到或被久久地留住。","pronunciation":["배ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6d5a827759182c6b1f34.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.722,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=35777","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":133,"sequenceScore":2.5487,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我家乡的妈妈寄来了信哦。","哇！感觉每一句都饱含着妈妈的爱呢。","昨天演出结束后，你怎么没来庆功宴啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我家乡的妈妈寄来了信哦。","哇！感觉每一句都饱含着妈妈的爱呢。","昨天演出结束后，你怎么没来庆功宴啊？"],"answ